  "notes": "BA Music Performance, Voice emphasis. Catalog prints 120 total hours for both emphases but the voice-emphasis rows as printed sum to 122 (18+17+16+16+14+14+14+13 = 122) — a catalog arithmetic error kept verbatim; total_credits is the honest sequenced sum (122). Admission requires a faculty audition; students must pass the Sophomore Qualifying exam to move into 300-level applied study. A Piano emphasis sequence also exists in the catalog (not collected). Curriculum pattern from the official Talladega College catalog (2018-2020).",
